# Margaret's chapter is four sets of rooms with no door between them anywhere
# in the data. The wireless is what joins them: tune it to a station and step
# back, and you are in that part of her house.
#
# The dial moves four at a time and the stations sit at bedroom 36,
# diningRm 56, kitchen 88 and livingRm 196 -- but only the stations that are
# on the air can be tuned, and the chapter opens with just the bedroom and
# the kitchen. The other two are earned.
bedrm_radio
state tunedin
# turn the dial up to the kitchen at 88
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
state gstaticwhere
# step back, and out into the kitchen
click 300 200
# the kitchen keeps the same radio, so the way back is the same way
bedrm_radio
# down to the bedroom at 36
click 390 335
click 390 335
click 390 335
click 390 335
click 390 335
click 390 335
click 390 335
click 390 335
click 390 335
click 390 335
click 390 335
click 390 335
click 390 335
state gstaticwhere
click 300 200

# The dining room is not on the air at the start. It is earned with the
# knitting needle: call the dumb waiter up from the kitchen, put the needle
# into it in the bedroom, send it back down, and take it out below.
kitchen_dWaiter
click 254 246
state dumbwaiter
bedrm_knitting
click 200 330
state knittingneedle
kitchen_dWaiter
click 254 265
state dumbwaiter
kitchen_dWaiter_cu
click 315 295
state tunedin
# and now the dial finds it, at 56 -- five turns up from the bedroom's 36
bedrm_radio
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
click 412 335
state gstaticwhere
click 300 200
state madeitodr
